      },
      "message": "fix(ui): add tooltips to the main viewport controls\n\nAdd plain-English labels and descriptive hover tooltips to all 12 icon controls in the main viewport bottom bar (#2914). Toggle controls reflect their current on/off state, display mode, or latched navigation mode. Attach widget info for accessibility and keyboard focus support.\n\nPinned by:\n- egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::nav_buttons_have_distinct_labels_and_descriptive_tooltips\n- egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::nav_buttons_attach_tooltips_on_hover\n\nChangelog: UI: add hover tooltips and accessibility labels to the 12 main viewport controls\n\nFixes #2914",
