      "message": "fix(ui): give the viewport bar buttons names no other control uses\n\nThe bar's accessible names \"Display mode\" and \"Show all toolpaths\"\nwere also the names of the Display menu group and the View menu\ncheck box, so a query by name found two nodes. The Wire, Paths and\nProjection buttons are now \"Switch wireframe\", \"Show or hide\ntoolpaths\" and \"Switch projection\"; the state text stays in the\ntooltip. The label test checks that no name repeats.\n\nRefs #2914\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
